Third-party packages and firmware
---------------------------------

Firmware images produced by the build workflow combine ImmortalWrt/OpenWrt and
third-party apk packages. Their licenses and source pins are recorded per build
in the source-offer manifest (`/builds/<id>/source-offer`). This repository does
not vendor or mirror third-party source trees or binary package feeds:

- Official ImmortalWrt feeds are referenced by their published URLs and pinned
  feed commits.
- The dllkids feed is referenced only by URL and the sha256 of its
  `packages.adb`; no dllkids source or binary is mirrored here.
- The self-built supplement feed is signed and hosted separately from this
  repository; this repository contains none of its build artifacts.

No proprietary binary is offered for public download by this repository. Builds
containing packages marked proprietary or missing a license are flagged as
private-use only and must not be published as public images.

